                [ 'h2', 'xTool P3 or X1: which CO₂ laser for production?' ],
                [ 'p', 'The P3 is xTool’s flagship CO₂ laser, built for fast cutting and engraving of large sheets: 80 W, a 914 × 457 mm bed, up to 1,200 mm/s, four cameras and the ACS™ workflow. The Versatile Bundle adds the conveyor, a mobile work stand and the RA3 rotary, and the All-in-one Bundle also the SafetyPro™ AP2 Max purifier. For marking metal, xTool offers a 5 W infrared laser module for the P3 and a bundle of the P3 with the portable F2.' ],
                [ 'products', '9089720189141' ],
                [ 'p', 'The X1 is a platform with Laser Swap™, which supports five laser types: CO₂, diode, UV, MOPA and fibre. The Single CO₂ version does not accept other sources. The CO₂ + Diode Galvo version adds a 20 W diode galvo module; with it you can buy a 5 W UV, 60 W MOPA or 30 W fibre source and combine it with CO₂ in a single job. In the X1 description xTool focuses on versatility rather than CO₂ tube power and bed size – if you mainly cut thick material, compare these figures in the full specification.' ],
